<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n41934" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">rŭbus</span></b> , i, m.
			(<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>fem.</i>,
					<i><span class="en">Prud. Cath. 5, 31</span></i>;
					<i><span class="en">id. Apoth. 123</span></i>) [kindr. with
			ruber]. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>A bramble-bush</i>, <i>blackberry-bush</i>, <i><span class="en">Plin. 16, 37, 71, § 180</span></i>;
				<i><span class="en">17, 13, 21, §
				96</span></i>; <i><span class="en">24, 13,
				73, § 117 al.</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Verg. E. 3,
				89</span></i>; <i><span class="en">id. G. 3, 315</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Hor. C. 1,
				23, 6</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Ov. Nux, 113</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Caes. B. G.
				2, 17, 4</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Liv. 23, 30</span></i> Drak. <i>N. cr.;</i>
			<i><span class="en">Col.
				11, 3, 4 sq.</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Vulg. Exod. 3,
			2</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>A blackberry</i>, <i><span class="en">Prop. 3,
			13</span></i> (4, 12), 28: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">fraga rubosque colligere,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Calp.
					Ecl. 4, 31</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
